     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">For graduate students and postdocs, see below for more information about the STRIDE program.  The application deadline is March 8<sup>th</sup>!\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michele Tobias, PhD<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">GIS Data Curator<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466108970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cZs4O4k8uqylrNbQjl-so\">Data Management Program</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Data &amp; Digital Scholarship<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">UC Davis Library <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">161 Shields Library<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-7532\" value=\"+15307527532\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530)752-7532</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmto...@ucdavis.edu</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">ORCID: </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif;color:#494a4c;background:white\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2954-8710&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466108970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JUKR7OwsXT30AiOS-2jtb\">0000-0002-2954-8710</a>\r\n</span><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Pronouns: she, her, hers<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">manage_da...@ucdavis.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">manage_da...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Vessela Y Ensberg<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, February 15, 2019 3:09 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> manage_data Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">manag...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [manage_data] STRIDE Summer 2019 Incubator: Call For Proposals for Graduate Students &amp; Postdocs<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Got a research idea, but need the data? Got data, but need to make sense of them?</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">Check out\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">STRIDE</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\"> (“Successful Transformation of a Research Idea into Data Engagement”) – a summer research\r\n preparedness program through the Library’s Data Management Program for graduate students and postdocs.\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Application deadline is</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">March 8<sup>th</sup></span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">. The program runs Aug 5-Sept 13.<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">STRIDE is a great opportunity to explore novel data sources to answer a question relevant to your research field. The Incubator builds skills for reproducible science including:<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">• Getting data from API (e.g. Twitter, Facebook, OpenStreetMap, NOAA, NASA, census, etc.)<br>\r\n• Reformatting data: file formats, character encoding<br>\r\n• Cleaning data and exploring data quality<br>\r\n• Organizing data: spreadsheets to databases; setting up reproducible workflows<br>\r\n• Sharing data: documentation and repository<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">For more information and application details, visit\r\n</span><a href=\"https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/stride/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/stride/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466108970000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rTpGNF2k8IWav9rhHys4q\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">https://www.library.ucdavis.edu/service/data-management/stride/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\"><u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-weight:normal\">Regards,<u></u><u></u></span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Vessela Ensberg<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Associate Director, Data Management Program<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Data and Digital Scholarship Department<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">UC Davis Library<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
